    "Files left in your Library by apps that are no longer installed. Nothing is checked for you: look at each item before removing it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fichiers laissés dans votre Bibliothèque par des apps qui ne sont plus installées. Rien n'est coché d'avance : vérifiez chaque élément avant de le supprimer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If macOS refuses, allow Vrac in System Settings > Privacy & Security > App Management, or drag the app to the Trash in the Finder.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
